  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b13b48e65550d1a4f80dbc0550ba6b7b, type: 3}
  m_Name: PageJournal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  npcName: Guard
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a12205541509adf4eba26d9cead915af, type: 3}
  playerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aac3ceb7a1214734aaa33b9d5bd4941c, type: 3}
  isBadDecision: 0
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: So she was indeed part of the expedition...
  - speaker: 0
    text: Who are you talking about?
  - speaker: 1
    text: From the most devoted woman I have ever seen, a woman who would have given
      everything for her daughter.
  - speaker: 1
    text: And I guess she was ready to go up the mountain for her.
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'And did she find her daughter at the top? '
  - speaker: 1
    text: If you find her, she will answer you herself. But I sincerely hope that
      she has finally been able to talk to her again.
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'If only I had known that she had decided to climb the mountain, I would
      have given her some of my help, a help I should have given her long before... '
